{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pxQ7vsKcJf1793539031.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>全球最大加密貨幣交易所幣安，日前遭到歷來最大規模黑客攻擊後，宣布分階段恢復提款。</p><p></p><p>路透社報道，幣安本港時間今日下午2時至5時，開始分階段恢復提款服務，在完成安全與穩定性檢查後，逐步恢復更多加密貨幣及區塊鏈網絡的提款功能，幣安表示，已補回約九成被盜的加密貨幣，重申客戶不須承擔任何財務損失。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BINANCE 1900_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265Bwqslc68T1793539062.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>幣安過去周四遭最大規模黑客攻擊，損失折合逾490億港元，一度被迫暫停交易，分析指，在黑客可以利用人工智能進行網絡攻擊下，事件令業界對加密貨幣，安全問題憂慮升溫。美國聯邦調查局(FBI)指，今次是朝鮮黑客組織發動的網絡攻擊。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:17.525919+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":256,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T13:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T15:38:16.508253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:49.022052+00:00","content_hash":"236f3ccbe598a9223e0479c2fd59129ca7fc394d11e86bd69b16080ebae8d76c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:17.525919+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}